1
00:03:08,760 --> 00:03:11,040
<i>Why didn't you just tell
your granddaughter the truth?</i>

2
00:03:11,880 --> 00:03:14,360
<i>Hathaya has suffered enough already.</i>

3
00:03:14,440 --> 00:03:18,880
I don't want my granddaughter
to worry any more than she already does.

4
00:03:18,960 --> 00:03:20,320
What are you planning?

5
00:03:20,400 --> 00:03:21,920
Hathaya is trending right now.

6
00:03:22,000 --> 00:03:22,720
PREVIOUSLY

7
00:03:22,800 --> 00:03:24,080
<i>If we use this opportunity,</i>

8
00:03:24,160 --> 00:03:27,200
<i>we can turn a crisis into an advantage.</i>

9
00:03:27,280 --> 00:03:30,560
I'd like you to talk to Mr. Pichai
and ask for his permission for me

10
00:03:30,640 --> 00:03:34,360
<i>to seriously date Chayanee.</i>

11
00:03:34,440 --> 00:03:35,880
Chayanee.

12
00:03:35,960 --> 00:03:38,600
<i>Raiwin brought Mr. Saksit.
They're already here.</i>

13
00:03:38,680 --> 00:03:40,440
- Thank you very much.
- Right.

14
00:03:40,520 --> 00:03:41,640
The roses are beautiful.

15
00:03:42,840 --> 00:03:44,720
What's the occasion?

16
00:03:44,800 --> 00:03:46,920
That's a long story.

17
00:03:47,960 --> 00:03:50,120
Roses represent love.

18
00:03:50,200 --> 00:03:54,160
I'm here today as Raiwin's father.

19
00:03:56,160 --> 00:03:58,160
He insisted that we should
make things official.

20
00:03:58,240 --> 00:03:59,920
Make what official?

21
00:04:01,720 --> 00:04:03,160
Chayanee is here right on time.

22
00:04:18,279 --> 00:04:20,880
Sir, Miss Hathaya is here.

23
00:04:31,640 --> 00:04:32,760
Hello, Uncle Saksit.

24
00:04:33,920 --> 00:04:35,240
Hello, Miss Hathaya.

25
00:04:39,600 --> 00:04:40,400
Hello.

26
00:04:43,960 --> 00:04:46,840
Grandpa, Aunt Ann said
you were asking for me.

27
00:04:46,920 --> 00:04:48,400
I didn't know you had guests.

28
00:04:48,480 --> 00:04:50,480
Well, you're here now. Stay here and wait.

29
00:04:52,960 --> 00:04:53,800
Yes.

30
00:04:53,880 --> 00:04:56,880
Let's get back to the important matter.

31
00:04:58,440 --> 00:05:00,880
Mr. Saksit, is there something
you wanted to discuss?

32
00:05:03,920 --> 00:05:06,280
I'll get straight to the point.

33
00:05:08,280 --> 00:05:12,760
My son Raiwin has feelings
for your granddaughter.

34
00:05:14,400 --> 00:05:17,320
He asked me to come
and ask you for permission

35
00:05:17,400 --> 00:05:19,280
so they can do this properly.

36
00:05:19,360 --> 00:05:22,440
I understand that love and attraction
are personal matters.

37
00:05:23,600 --> 00:05:27,240
But I admire young people who show respect

38
00:05:27,760 --> 00:05:29,280
to the woman's elders.

39
00:05:29,920 --> 00:05:30,920
Raiwin.

40
00:05:34,000 --> 00:05:35,760
Thank you, Mr. Pichai.

41
00:05:42,240 --> 00:05:43,080
I...

42
00:05:44,360 --> 00:05:48,760
I would like to ask
your permission to date Hathaya.

43
00:06:09,520 --> 00:06:12,160
Mr. Raiwin, did you say the wrong name?

44
00:06:13,600 --> 00:06:17,040
Dad, I love Chayanee, not Hathaya.

45
00:06:17,120 --> 00:06:19,360
Love is one thing,

46
00:06:20,080 --> 00:06:23,200
but right now, you need
to think about your future.

47
00:06:23,280 --> 00:06:26,120
Understand? Hathaya is getting

48
00:06:26,200 --> 00:06:27,640
a lot of attention right now.

49
00:06:27,720 --> 00:06:30,720
You need to ride that wave.

50
00:06:30,800 --> 00:06:31,760
He didn't.

51
00:06:32,960 --> 00:06:34,280
He asked me to come here himself.

52
00:06:35,600 --> 00:06:37,480
I really do want to date Hathaya.

53
00:06:45,000 --> 00:06:48,800
If you were talking about Chayanee,
I wouldn't be surprised at all.

54
00:06:49,320 --> 00:06:51,000
You've known each other for a long time.

55
00:06:51,920 --> 00:06:54,120
But Hathaya has only
been here a short while.

56
00:06:55,440 --> 00:06:57,840
When did the two of you become so close?

57
00:06:58,840 --> 00:07:00,720
I only recently met Hathaya,

58
00:07:01,440 --> 00:07:02,840
but I'm very impressed by her.

59
00:07:03,680 --> 00:07:07,320
She is selfless, and she stands up
for what is right for other people.

60
00:07:08,240 --> 00:07:10,720
I know this may be too soon.

61
00:07:11,280 --> 00:07:15,920
That's why I want to ask you for
the opportunity to get to know her better.

62
00:07:17,360 --> 00:07:21,240
I already said that
love is between two people.

63
00:07:21,760 --> 00:07:23,440
If you care for each other, fine.

64
00:07:25,600 --> 00:07:29,040
Just don't do anything inappropriate.

65
00:07:31,360 --> 00:07:32,560
Thank you.

66
00:07:50,800 --> 00:07:51,640
I don't think

67
00:07:52,280 --> 00:07:56,600
that outfit suits you. Better stick
to your construction clothes.

68
00:07:57,520 --> 00:08:00,720
Thanks for the advice,
but next time, don't.

69
00:08:01,320 --> 00:08:02,360
Get in.

70
00:08:04,360 --> 00:08:06,520
I'm definitely not riding
in the truck bed.

71
00:08:06,600 --> 00:08:08,160
Suit yourself.

72
00:08:09,280 --> 00:08:11,440
Come on. Get in.

73
00:08:14,360 --> 00:08:15,280
Hathaya.

74
00:08:17,440 --> 00:08:18,280
I'll drive you.

75
00:08:22,920 --> 00:08:23,760
Thank you.

76
00:08:43,400 --> 00:08:46,360
Madam, hurry and comfort Miss Chayanee.

77
00:08:46,440 --> 00:08:48,840
She's probably tearing
the place apart by now.

78
00:08:56,680 --> 00:08:58,720
Chamoi, go outside.

79
00:09:13,960 --> 00:09:15,240
Chayanee.

80
00:09:17,520 --> 00:09:18,920
Cry if you need to, sweetheart.

81
00:09:19,600 --> 00:09:21,240
Go ahead and cry.

82
00:09:23,440 --> 00:09:25,880
When you sit there in silence like this,

83
00:09:26,680 --> 00:09:28,160
it only makes me worry more.

84
00:09:35,080 --> 00:09:38,920
Why does she always
have to keep hurting me?

85
00:09:41,960 --> 00:09:44,000
Dad died because of her.

86
00:09:46,520 --> 00:09:48,600
Then she stole my project from me.

87
00:09:49,560 --> 00:09:52,680
And now she's trying
to steal the man I love.

88
00:09:55,000 --> 00:09:59,360
I hate her, Mom. I hate her.

89
00:10:00,680 --> 00:10:02,200
I hate her too, Chayanee.

90
00:10:06,320 --> 00:10:07,360
Chayanee.

91
00:10:08,760 --> 00:10:11,560
My daughter has to be strong.

92
00:10:15,160 --> 00:10:16,800
Don't let her win.

93
00:10:18,600 --> 00:10:20,520
I'll never let her.

94
00:10:22,000 --> 00:10:25,520
I'm going to take back everything
that belongs to me.

95
00:10:45,640 --> 00:10:46,480
Mr. Raiwin.

96
00:10:47,680 --> 00:10:48,520
Yes?

97
00:10:49,040 --> 00:10:52,440
Why do you want to get to know me?

98
00:10:53,000 --> 00:10:56,280
We're practically strangers.

99
00:10:56,800 --> 00:10:58,160
You know very little about me.

100
00:10:59,480 --> 00:11:01,160
I don't care how long I've known someone.

101
00:11:01,880 --> 00:11:07,440
Even after years together,
it doesn't always work out.

102
00:11:10,520 --> 00:11:14,600
Then why do you want to date me?

103
00:11:17,120 --> 00:11:19,640
I like the way you think.
I like your attitude.

104
00:11:21,520 --> 00:11:22,560
Do you know

105
00:11:23,200 --> 00:11:24,840
how impressed I was with you that day?

106
00:11:27,560 --> 00:11:28,760
<i>Chief.</i>

107
00:11:29,360 --> 00:11:32,600
True democracy isn't only about
listening to the majority.

108
00:11:33,200 --> 00:11:34,800
It also means listening to the minority.

109
00:11:35,400 --> 00:11:36,800
We need to work together to solve this.

110
00:11:36,880 --> 00:11:40,200
We need to find
the fairest solution and proceed.

111
00:11:41,640 --> 00:11:45,960
Believe it or not, my whole life,
I've never once argued with my father.

112
00:11:47,480 --> 00:11:48,400
But that day,

113
00:11:49,560 --> 00:11:53,720
you had the courage to speak up.
You weren't afraid to speak your mind

114
00:11:53,800 --> 00:11:54,880
and do what's right.

115
00:12:00,120 --> 00:12:01,160
I like you.

116
00:12:07,520 --> 00:12:08,920
What about you?

117
00:12:12,560 --> 00:12:13,720
Could you date me?

118
00:12:16,040 --> 00:12:16,920
Uh...

119
00:12:19,440 --> 00:12:23,080
I think it's too soon.

120
00:12:25,320 --> 00:12:27,680
You've always given other people a chance.

121
00:12:28,840 --> 00:12:29,840
Give me one too.

122
00:12:37,840 --> 00:12:38,720
All right.

123
00:12:39,800 --> 00:12:42,040
Then let time prove it.

124
00:12:43,400 --> 00:12:44,280
Okay.

125
00:12:45,720 --> 00:12:47,440
I'll prove to you that

126
00:12:48,360 --> 00:12:51,600
I like you and that I'm sincere.

127
00:12:58,040 --> 00:13:01,040
I think we should get going.

128
00:13:03,320 --> 00:13:04,160
Right.

129
00:13:35,640 --> 00:13:36,720
Hey, Max!

130
00:13:36,800 --> 00:13:39,480
You scared me! It's me.
Who are you looking for, boss?

131
00:13:40,560 --> 00:13:41,800
A worker.

132
00:13:41,880 --> 00:13:43,920
Who? Oh!

133
00:13:44,000 --> 00:13:46,680
I saw your brother

134
00:13:46,760 --> 00:13:49,320
drop Hathaya off
at the model home earlier.

135
00:13:50,880 --> 00:13:52,320
Isn't she working with us anymore?

136
00:13:53,280 --> 00:13:55,000
Mr. Pichai put her on the sales team.

137
00:13:56,200 --> 00:13:57,440
Damn, that's a shame.

138
00:13:57,520 --> 00:14:00,320
No more pretty girl around
to brighten up the place.

139
00:14:02,880 --> 00:14:03,760
Max.

140
00:14:03,840 --> 00:14:06,080
- Come with me.
- Where are we going?

141
00:14:06,160 --> 00:14:08,120
Wait for me, boss.

142
00:14:08,200 --> 00:14:09,400
What the hell?

143
00:14:10,520 --> 00:14:11,880
Wait up!

144
00:14:15,440 --> 00:14:19,960
Hey, Max. Go check whether
any of the faucets are leaking.

145
00:14:22,080 --> 00:14:25,800
Go on. Upstairs. Hurry.

146
00:14:40,680 --> 00:14:43,160
You can take them
to sign the agreement now.

147
00:14:43,720 --> 00:14:45,080
Right this way, please.

148
00:14:51,320 --> 00:14:52,760
Do you have something to tell me?

149
00:14:54,640 --> 00:14:56,160
No. Nothing.

150
00:15:01,440 --> 00:15:02,680
Really?

151
00:15:02,760 --> 00:15:04,720
- Well...
- Well, what?

152
00:15:06,360 --> 00:15:08,560
- Maybe I do.
- Then say it.

153
00:15:09,760 --> 00:15:10,880
Do you like Raiwin?

154
00:15:12,760 --> 00:15:15,200
Well, he's good looking.

155
00:15:15,280 --> 00:15:17,080
And he's a gentleman.

156
00:15:19,200 --> 00:15:23,320
You just met him.
How do you know he's a gentleman?

157
00:15:24,760 --> 00:15:29,000
At least he's better than you. He's not
aggressive, and he actually respects me.

158
00:15:30,680 --> 00:15:34,080
Look. Don't trust people so easily.

159
00:15:34,160 --> 00:15:36,080
I don't want you to end up being used.

160
00:15:36,160 --> 00:15:39,000
That family will do anything
for their own benefit.

161
00:15:39,840 --> 00:15:40,920
Oh,

162
00:15:41,520 --> 00:15:44,880
and watch yourself. Your little sister
might not be too happy about this.

163
00:15:46,320 --> 00:15:48,200
What are you trying to tell me?

164
00:15:48,280 --> 00:15:49,640
Why bring up Chayanee?

165
00:15:49,720 --> 00:15:51,000
Boss.

166
00:15:51,960 --> 00:15:54,760
The faucets are fine. Nothing's broken.
What am I supposed to fix?

167
00:15:57,200 --> 00:15:58,600
Go back to the site then.

168
00:16:00,720 --> 00:16:02,840
Go. Go!

169
00:16:02,920 --> 00:16:04,720
Then why did you drag me over here?

170
00:16:04,800 --> 00:16:06,000
Max, wait.

171
00:16:07,120 --> 00:16:08,720
Can I ask you something?

172
00:16:10,160 --> 00:16:11,080
What is it?

173
00:16:44,920 --> 00:16:47,920
Boss isn't Mr. Saksit's biological son.

174
00:16:48,000 --> 00:16:53,040
His mom had him before meeting Mr. Saksit,
so only Raiwin is his biological son.

175
00:16:53,680 --> 00:16:57,400
But everyone knows
Raiwin and Chayanee are together.

176
00:16:57,480 --> 00:16:59,160
That's why I'm confused too.

177
00:16:59,240 --> 00:17:01,800
Why would he still drive you here?

178
00:17:01,880 --> 00:17:03,040
I really don't get it.

179
00:17:03,120 --> 00:17:05,560
He has a girlfriend,
but he's still chasing someone else.

180
00:17:10,960 --> 00:17:12,319
I came to return the card.

181
00:17:13,160 --> 00:17:14,680
I probably won't be back anymore.

182
00:17:18,200 --> 00:17:19,000
I'm sorry.

183
00:17:20,000 --> 00:17:21,520
You lied to me!

184
00:17:23,119 --> 00:17:25,800
You said your father was going
to ask permission to date me.

185
00:17:27,000 --> 00:17:29,200
But in the end, you wanted Hathaya.

186
00:17:30,760 --> 00:17:32,720
I told my father to ask for you.

187
00:17:34,240 --> 00:17:37,040
But he ordered me to date Hathaya.

188
00:17:37,120 --> 00:17:38,520
How old are you?

189
00:17:39,240 --> 00:17:42,240
Nine? Ten? Do you still need
your father telling you what to do?

190
00:17:42,320 --> 00:17:43,680
Are you just his dog on a leash?

191
00:17:43,760 --> 00:17:46,240
- That's going too far.
- What did I say that was wrong?

192
00:17:46,320 --> 00:17:47,840
Your father tells you to turn left,

193
00:17:47,920 --> 00:17:51,720
you turn left. He tells you
to turn right, you turn right.

194
00:17:52,240 --> 00:17:55,360
If your father told you to go die,
would you go die too?!

195
00:17:55,440 --> 00:17:57,240
Then what do you want me to do?

196
00:18:31,720 --> 00:18:33,400
Do you still love me?

197
00:18:37,600 --> 00:18:39,920
Answer me. Do you still love me?

198
00:18:41,880 --> 00:18:43,080
Raiwin.

199
00:18:47,000 --> 00:18:48,320
What do you want me to do?

200
00:18:54,440 --> 00:18:56,200
You don't have to do anything.

201
00:18:58,360 --> 00:19:01,440
Just keep being
your father's precious son.

202
00:19:01,520 --> 00:19:03,640
That's all. I'll take care
of everything else.

203
00:19:35,120 --> 00:19:36,160
Chaya.

204
00:19:39,040 --> 00:19:41,600
I'm sorry.

205
00:19:42,120 --> 00:19:44,920
I didn't know you and Raiwin
had been together.

206
00:19:47,920 --> 00:19:50,280
Do you think I'm upset, Hathaya?

207
00:19:53,720 --> 00:19:56,560
Yes, I am upset.

208
00:19:57,560 --> 00:20:01,120
But what can I do? We all have to move on.

209
00:20:02,680 --> 00:20:05,760
I'll talk to him.
You and I can still be friends.

210
00:20:05,840 --> 00:20:08,000
You don't need to do anything.

211
00:20:09,600 --> 00:20:13,600
My relationship is over.
And I don't want to talk about it anymore.

212
00:20:18,000 --> 00:20:19,760
Don't worry.

213
00:20:20,360 --> 00:20:23,120
We're sisters. We share the same blood.

214
00:20:23,760 --> 00:20:27,000
We shouldn't let an outsider
come between us and drive us apart.

215
00:20:29,840 --> 00:20:33,840
Thank you so much
for caring about how I feel,

216
00:20:34,360 --> 00:20:36,200
my wonderful big sister.

217
00:20:55,760 --> 00:20:56,720
Then I'll get going.

218
00:21:13,280 --> 00:21:14,960
I already have a plan.

219
00:21:23,960 --> 00:21:24,960
She's inside.

220
00:21:36,160 --> 00:21:39,200
I told you not to upset the customers.

221
00:21:40,160 --> 00:21:43,440
Give them what they want.
Then you can send the money home.

222
00:21:44,640 --> 00:21:46,040
See what happens when you resist?

223
00:21:54,520 --> 00:21:56,680
Come here. Does it hurt badly?

224
00:22:01,600 --> 00:22:03,960
Okay. Don't be afraid.

225
00:22:04,600 --> 00:22:08,480
I'll take you to the hospital.
Then I'll take you home.

226
00:22:29,280 --> 00:22:32,280
I just finished some business.
What can I do for you, Ms. Liu?

227
00:22:32,800 --> 00:22:34,160
Just tell me.

228
00:22:56,240 --> 00:22:58,040
You're finished here. Go.

229
00:23:00,160 --> 00:23:01,080
Yes.

230
00:23:02,680 --> 00:23:03,760
Stay for a moment.

231
00:23:25,480 --> 00:23:28,640
Aunt Liu, do you need anything else?
I can get it for you.

232
00:23:29,800 --> 00:23:31,200
No need, sweetheart.

233
00:23:35,920 --> 00:23:37,080
Father.

234
00:23:37,160 --> 00:23:39,840
Chayanee and I were thinking

235
00:23:39,920 --> 00:23:42,400
that so many good things
have happened to our family lately.

236
00:23:42,480 --> 00:23:46,480
There's the success in the development,
and now Mr. Saksit's son

237
00:23:46,560 --> 00:23:49,640
has asked to date Hathaya.

238
00:23:57,080 --> 00:23:59,720
Mom and I thought we should

239
00:24:00,360 --> 00:24:02,920
have a small celebration.

240
00:24:06,080 --> 00:24:08,920
Something this minor
doesn't need a celebration.

241
00:24:09,960 --> 00:24:12,280
But Grandpa,

242
00:24:12,360 --> 00:24:15,560
I want to hold a party to celebrate
Hathaya coming home.

243
00:24:15,640 --> 00:24:18,960
Please, Grandpa.

244
00:24:20,760 --> 00:24:22,640
Fine.

245
00:24:22,720 --> 00:24:27,080
Keep it private. Nothing too formal.

246
00:24:27,880 --> 00:24:29,120
Thank you, Grandpa.

247
00:24:29,200 --> 00:24:32,480
I love you more than anyone.

248
00:24:33,840 --> 00:24:35,400
Then,

249
00:24:35,480 --> 00:24:39,560
we'll keep it simple.
We'll only invite Mr. Saksit's family.

250
00:24:39,640 --> 00:24:43,440
After all, our families
may soon be joined together.

251
00:24:48,000 --> 00:24:50,680
Hathaya, make sure you're ready.

252
00:24:52,560 --> 00:24:54,200
Thank you, Chaya.

253
00:24:58,120 --> 00:25:00,200
Then so be it.

254
00:25:15,480 --> 00:25:18,240
I'm going to be honest with you,
Miss Hathaya.

255
00:25:19,520 --> 00:25:22,600
I don't understand this at all,
and I don't feel good about it.

256
00:25:22,680 --> 00:25:25,840
Why would Madam and Miss Chayanee suddenly

257
00:25:25,920 --> 00:25:28,240
want to throw you a welcome party

258
00:25:28,320 --> 00:25:31,720
when they've been trying
to drive you out this whole time?

259
00:25:33,880 --> 00:25:36,520
Maybe Aunt Liu finally sees that
I came here with good intentions.

260
00:25:36,600 --> 00:25:38,120
I'm here to help Grandpa.

261
00:25:38,640 --> 00:25:41,080
I'd bet my life on it.

262
00:25:41,160 --> 00:25:43,600
I've been with Madam a long time.

263
00:25:43,680 --> 00:25:46,760
I know exactly what those two are like.

264
00:25:46,840 --> 00:25:49,160
They hate anyone getting
more attention than them.

265
00:25:50,160 --> 00:25:52,240
Then what do you want me to do, Aunt Ann?

266
00:25:53,320 --> 00:25:57,920
I really wish this party wasn't happening.
I just have a bad feeling about it.

267
00:26:00,720 --> 00:26:02,400
Stop right there!

268
00:26:02,480 --> 00:26:06,360
You two are gossiping about
my beloved boss. I'm going to tell her.

269
00:26:07,120 --> 00:26:11,120
Madam finally opened her heart
and accepted you parasites,

270
00:26:11,200 --> 00:26:14,520
and this is how you repay her,
thinking such evil thoughts?

271
00:26:15,120 --> 00:26:19,000
I guess some people
are just content being parasites.

272
00:26:19,800 --> 00:26:23,720
My boss does good for sinners
and gets nothing in return.

273
00:26:23,800 --> 00:26:26,640
Who are you calling a sinner?
You're the real sinner.

274
00:26:26,720 --> 00:26:28,440
The King of Hell and the Grim Reaper

275
00:26:28,520 --> 00:26:31,320
already have a place waiting for you.
Do you even know that?

276
00:26:31,400 --> 00:26:33,760
- Watch your mouth!
- Wait!

277
00:26:34,440 --> 00:26:37,040
Please don't fight. Please.

278
00:26:38,480 --> 00:26:41,760
Aunt Ann, it's time for me to go to work.

279
00:26:42,680 --> 00:26:43,920
Can you take over here?

280
00:26:44,000 --> 00:26:45,160
No!

281
00:26:45,240 --> 00:26:47,680
You're staying here as a servant,

282
00:26:47,760 --> 00:26:51,200
so you have to work.
You can't keep making excuses.

283
00:26:51,280 --> 00:26:53,320
Go ahead, Miss Hathaya.

284
00:26:53,400 --> 00:26:55,320
It's fine.

285
00:26:55,400 --> 00:26:56,400
Bye. Bye.

286
00:26:57,560 --> 00:26:59,040
Hey!

287
00:26:59,120 --> 00:27:01,320
Don't make such a big deal
out of everything.

288
00:27:01,400 --> 00:27:06,200
If one day Mr. Pichai accepts her and she
becomes his favorite granddaughter,

289
00:27:06,280 --> 00:27:07,840
you'll have no place left here.

290
00:27:07,920 --> 00:27:11,880
Just because one video went viral?
She won't be his favorite.

291
00:27:11,960 --> 00:27:14,720
Don't imagine things.

292
00:27:14,800 --> 00:27:16,000
Chamoi, stop right now!

293
00:27:16,080 --> 00:27:18,240
- Why?
- You really want to test me?

294
00:27:18,320 --> 00:27:21,440
Come at me then!

295
00:27:30,200 --> 00:27:31,680
Careful.

296
00:27:32,280 --> 00:27:33,320
I'm sorry.

297
00:27:33,400 --> 00:27:36,120
My name is Pong.
I'm here to work for Mr. Pichai.

298
00:27:36,720 --> 00:27:39,960
Nice to meet you.
I'm in a hurry, so I need to get to work.

299
00:27:40,720 --> 00:27:41,680
Of course.

300
00:27:49,160 --> 00:27:52,960
Last year, Pong resigned
to take care of his sick mother.

301
00:27:53,040 --> 00:27:55,120
Now that she's recovered,

302
00:27:55,200 --> 00:27:59,160
he would like to come back
and work here again.

303
00:28:01,480 --> 00:28:03,320
I can drive for you

304
00:28:03,400 --> 00:28:07,400
or supervise work like I used to.
I can do anything you need, sir.

305
00:28:08,000 --> 00:28:09,120
That's good.

306
00:28:09,640 --> 00:28:11,880
The development could use some extra help.

307
00:28:13,200 --> 00:28:14,480
Thank you, sir.

308
00:28:14,560 --> 00:28:19,440
Then I'll have Pong stay
in his old room in the workers' quarters.

309
00:28:23,800 --> 00:28:25,960
Hathaya is already staying there.

310
00:28:29,680 --> 00:28:31,280
Let him stay in the room at the back.

311
00:28:31,360 --> 00:28:32,400
Yes, sir.

312
00:28:34,600 --> 00:28:37,200
I wanted you to stay over there.

313
00:28:37,280 --> 00:28:39,240
It would've made it easier
to get close to Hathaya.

314
00:28:39,320 --> 00:28:42,680
Too bad Father
is making you stay back here.

315
00:28:43,200 --> 00:28:44,560
You know me, madam.

316
00:28:45,440 --> 00:28:47,800
Distance is never a problem for me.

317
00:28:48,600 --> 00:28:51,600
I'm very good at making my move.

318
00:28:53,920 --> 00:28:56,320
You'd better be as good as you say.

319
00:28:56,400 --> 00:28:58,840
Don't make me regret calling you back.

320
00:29:00,880 --> 00:29:04,280
I won't disappoint you, madam.

321
00:29:31,400 --> 00:29:33,480
Ploy, please take care
of the customer for me.

322
00:29:43,400 --> 00:29:45,360
Why are you here?

323
00:29:50,560 --> 00:29:52,520
Raiwin asked me to bring this to you.

324
00:29:53,040 --> 00:29:55,640
He said he wants you
to wear this outfit to the party.

325
00:29:58,800 --> 00:30:00,080
Thank you.

326
00:30:00,920 --> 00:30:04,080
Where is Raiwin?
Why didn't he come himself?

327
00:30:04,680 --> 00:30:05,520
Hey.

328
00:30:06,400 --> 00:30:08,560
My name is Ramil, not Raiwin.

329
00:30:08,640 --> 00:30:10,440
If you want to know, ask him yourself.

330
00:30:11,680 --> 00:30:13,000
My job here is done.

331
00:30:13,080 --> 00:30:14,120
Wait.

332
00:30:14,680 --> 00:30:16,040
Are you coming tonight?

333
00:30:16,760 --> 00:30:20,520
It's not my party, and there's
nothing interesting about it anyway.

334
00:30:23,800 --> 00:30:24,880
I'm leaving.

335
00:30:42,720 --> 00:30:44,000
What was he doing here?

336
00:30:44,960 --> 00:30:47,480
Raiwin sent an outfit for me.

337
00:30:49,120 --> 00:30:53,360
Hathaya, don't trust that man too much.
He's dangerous.

338
00:30:55,160 --> 00:30:58,120
What's wrong with Ramil?

339
00:30:59,480 --> 00:31:01,840
I'll tell you later.

340
00:31:03,960 --> 00:31:06,400
At the party, you must be
the most beautiful woman.

341
00:31:07,360 --> 00:31:09,640
Can I see what you're going to wear?

342
00:31:10,680 --> 00:31:12,840
Of course. I'll show you.

343
00:31:33,120 --> 00:31:33,960
Step down.

344
00:31:34,480 --> 00:31:35,600
Alright.

345
00:31:39,360 --> 00:31:40,840
Careful, Father.

346
00:31:43,000 --> 00:31:44,120
Hello.

347
00:31:44,200 --> 00:31:45,600
- Hello, Mr. Pichai.
- Hello.

348
00:31:45,680 --> 00:31:47,400
Hello, Chief.

349
00:31:47,480 --> 00:31:48,960
Hello.

350
00:31:49,040 --> 00:31:52,760
Thank you for honoring my family
with an invitation tonight.

351
00:31:52,840 --> 00:31:54,240
We're all practically family.

352
00:31:55,760 --> 00:31:59,400
How has Ramil been? If he's caused you
any trouble or upset you in any way,

353
00:31:59,480 --> 00:32:00,800
I apologize on his behalf.

354
00:32:00,880 --> 00:32:03,800
Please don't worry
about that, Mrs. Sanguansri.

355
00:32:03,880 --> 00:32:07,240
Ramil has taken
a huge burden off my shoulders.

356
00:32:07,320 --> 00:32:08,760
Thank you very much.

357
00:32:11,760 --> 00:32:12,600
Hello, sir.

358
00:32:21,800 --> 00:32:24,840
Did you invite him here too?

359
00:32:25,440 --> 00:32:26,240
I didn't.

360
00:32:26,320 --> 00:32:27,920
- Then how--
- I invited Ramil myself.

361
00:32:28,560 --> 00:32:29,840
I wanted him to have fun too.

362
00:32:29,920 --> 00:32:31,360
Oh. Alright.

363
00:32:38,240 --> 00:32:40,520
Where's Hathaya?

364
00:32:41,400 --> 00:32:45,800
You're impatient, Raiwin.
You want to see the star of the evening?

365
00:32:47,160 --> 00:32:48,400
There she is.

366
00:33:47,880 --> 00:33:49,760
Hello.

367
00:33:52,560 --> 00:33:53,840
Thank you for doing this.

368
00:33:59,000 --> 00:34:02,360
I've been hearing your name for a while.
Today is the first time I've met you.

369
00:34:03,040 --> 00:34:04,800
You're very beautiful and sweet.

370
00:34:06,680 --> 00:34:07,960
Thank you very much.

371
00:34:14,480 --> 00:34:17,800
Everyone, the food is ready. Please come.

372
00:34:44,040 --> 00:34:45,600
Nothing left to do here. Take a break.

373
00:34:46,760 --> 00:34:47,960
Okay.

374
00:35:02,960 --> 00:35:05,480
I'm going to throw a party for Hathaya.

375
00:35:06,000 --> 00:35:08,520
Chayanee will get her drunk.

376
00:35:09,040 --> 00:35:12,040
Then you take care of her.

377
00:35:22,320 --> 00:35:24,000
You look very beautiful tonight.

378
00:35:24,960 --> 00:35:27,840
Dad and Auntie haven't
stopped complimenting you.

379
00:35:29,400 --> 00:35:32,280
I should thank you for this dress.

380
00:35:33,480 --> 00:35:35,720
I wanted you to look
more beautiful than anyone else,

381
00:35:35,800 --> 00:35:38,000
so every man in the world
would be jealous.

382
00:35:39,160 --> 00:35:41,000
You're exaggerating.

383
00:35:43,880 --> 00:35:47,200
There's at least one man here
who's definitely jealous.

384
00:36:03,000 --> 00:36:04,240
I'll get you another one.

385
00:36:05,280 --> 00:36:06,480
Thank you.

386
00:36:12,720 --> 00:36:15,720
Ramil, make me a drink.

387
00:36:23,880 --> 00:36:24,800
What are you doing?

388
00:36:25,720 --> 00:36:26,720
What do you mean?

389
00:36:27,720 --> 00:36:28,960
I'm not stupid.

390
00:36:30,120 --> 00:36:32,000
You've been with Chayanee for a long time.

391
00:36:33,240 --> 00:36:34,440
Now you've changed your mind?

392
00:36:35,640 --> 00:36:38,840
It's none of your business.
Just make the drink.

393
00:36:46,480 --> 00:36:47,520
Have a drink with me.

394
00:36:59,640 --> 00:37:03,880
Chaya. Are you going to tell me
what happened with Ramil?

395
00:37:07,320 --> 00:37:09,000
When he was in college,

396
00:37:09,560 --> 00:37:11,240
he raped a woman.

397
00:37:14,040 --> 00:37:16,760
Then why didn't she press charges?

398
00:37:18,280 --> 00:37:21,600
She was afraid of ruining her reputation,
so she didn't dare tell anyone.

399
00:37:23,240 --> 00:37:25,680
But everything came out
when she got pregnant.

400
00:37:27,240 --> 00:37:28,280
She got pregnant?

401
00:37:30,800 --> 00:37:33,560
She had to drop out of college.

402
00:37:33,640 --> 00:37:37,840
After that, nobody ever
talked about it again.

403
00:37:39,480 --> 00:37:41,280
How could he do something like that?

404
00:37:43,680 --> 00:37:47,240
You know Ramil is a mama's boy,

405
00:37:47,320 --> 00:37:49,760
and he isn't Uncle Saksit's
biological son.

406
00:37:51,120 --> 00:37:54,640
When he was little,
he was probably jealous of Raiwin.

407
00:37:54,720 --> 00:37:58,320
Whenever Raiwin got something,
Ramil always wanted to take it from him.

408
00:37:59,440 --> 00:38:02,880
Was that woman Raiwin's girlfriend?

409
00:38:06,560 --> 00:38:07,920
That's awful.

410
00:38:08,000 --> 00:38:09,360
Does Grandpa know about this?

411
00:38:11,120 --> 00:38:15,160
There's no evidence. If we said anything,
people would accuse us of slandering him.

412
00:38:15,760 --> 00:38:17,920
I'm only telling you

413
00:38:18,440 --> 00:38:22,120
because I'm afraid you might
become his next victim.

414
00:38:25,680 --> 00:38:28,320
I'm not going anywhere
near a man like that.

415
00:38:39,160 --> 00:38:42,400
If you don't love her,
and you don't really care about her,

416
00:38:43,400 --> 00:38:44,840
don't hurt her.

417
00:38:45,640 --> 00:38:47,040
Why do you care?

418
00:38:47,640 --> 00:38:51,360
I have to care. Because every time
you create a problem,

419
00:38:52,200 --> 00:38:53,880
I'm the one who has to fix it.

420
00:38:53,960 --> 00:38:55,120
That's your problem.

421
00:38:56,040 --> 00:38:58,480
I don't want another woman
becoming your victim.

422
00:38:59,480 --> 00:39:00,880
Let go.

423
00:39:10,720 --> 00:39:12,240
Go drag him home.

424
00:39:13,360 --> 00:39:14,360
Yes.

425
00:39:19,360 --> 00:39:21,160
You're drunk. That's enough.

426
00:39:21,240 --> 00:39:22,640
Don't drive when you're drunk.

427
00:39:24,720 --> 00:39:27,200
Why? Are you worried about me?

428
00:39:27,280 --> 00:39:28,520
Mr. Pichai,

429
00:39:29,400 --> 00:39:31,360
please excuse me for a moment.

430
00:39:31,960 --> 00:39:33,000
Of course.

431
00:39:39,680 --> 00:39:41,640
Come on, dear.
I'll ask Max to drive you home.

432
00:39:41,720 --> 00:39:42,760
Come on.

433
00:39:44,200 --> 00:39:48,600
I told you to drag him home!

434
00:39:52,360 --> 00:39:54,160
So your husband sent you.

435
00:39:58,080 --> 00:39:59,720
Come on. Come home with me.

436
00:39:59,800 --> 00:40:01,800
I'm not going. I'm still having fun.

437
00:40:01,880 --> 00:40:05,480
You're always causing trouble
for other people. Go home.

438
00:40:05,560 --> 00:40:08,480
You're not my father.
Don't tell me what to do.

439
00:40:09,840 --> 00:40:10,920
Ramil.

440
00:40:12,600 --> 00:40:14,640
Ramil. Listen.

441
00:40:15,480 --> 00:40:17,800
If he causes any trouble,

442
00:40:17,880 --> 00:40:20,240
you'll be responsible. Understand?

443
00:40:28,120 --> 00:40:30,480
I can't drink anymore, Chaya.

444
00:40:32,040 --> 00:40:35,800
Just one more glass, Hathaya.
This is the last one.

445
00:40:41,960 --> 00:40:43,240
The last one.

446
00:40:51,520 --> 00:40:52,680
Bottoms up.

447
00:41:01,680 --> 00:41:05,320
I'll go get you another one.

448
00:41:07,040 --> 00:41:08,840
I really can't drink anymore.

449
00:41:09,360 --> 00:41:12,440
Don't be difficult. I went through
all this trouble to convince Grandpa

450
00:41:12,520 --> 00:41:15,320
to throw this party for my beloved sister.

451
00:41:20,320 --> 00:41:21,480
I'll go refill your glass.

452
00:41:44,880 --> 00:41:45,840
Where are you going?

453
00:41:49,920 --> 00:41:50,760
Hey!

454
00:41:57,280 --> 00:41:58,280
Hathaya.

455
00:42:02,200 --> 00:42:03,960
Stay away from me!

456
00:42:04,680 --> 00:42:08,120
Why? Am I really that disgusting?

457
00:42:11,160 --> 00:42:13,240
I'm not that different from Raiwin.

458
00:42:13,320 --> 00:42:16,040
I'm clean too. If you don't
believe me, smell me.

459
00:42:16,760 --> 00:42:18,560
Don't touch me!

460
00:42:19,280 --> 00:42:21,160
A man like you is disgusting.

461
00:42:21,240 --> 00:42:23,120
What do you mean by that?

462
00:42:24,400 --> 00:42:25,840
Who said what about me this time?

463
00:42:25,920 --> 00:42:28,680
You know perfectly well what you did.

464
00:42:29,200 --> 00:42:32,400
Stay away from me. I don't want to be
anywhere near someone like you.

465
00:42:47,960 --> 00:42:49,960
Yes, madam. I'm ready.

466
00:43:14,400 --> 00:43:15,840
Hathaya, are you okay?

467
00:43:17,520 --> 00:43:19,480
Not really.

468
00:43:20,200 --> 00:43:22,200
I'll take you to your room.

469
00:43:39,280 --> 00:43:40,960
Chaya.

470
00:43:41,720 --> 00:43:44,000
I'm so dizzy.

471
00:43:45,080 --> 00:43:46,640
Why is everything spinning?

472
00:43:46,720 --> 00:43:50,000
Lie down and rest.
You'll feel better tomorrow.

473
00:43:53,320 --> 00:43:54,800
Chaya!

474
00:43:54,880 --> 00:43:56,880
Chaya. Don't go.

475
00:43:57,920 --> 00:44:00,520
Stay with me. Promise me.

476
00:44:01,120 --> 00:44:03,400
Okay, Hathaya. Get some rest.

477
00:44:04,640 --> 00:44:06,320
Stay with me.

478
00:44:31,880 --> 00:44:32,880
Who's that?

479
00:44:44,240 --> 00:44:47,440
Our part is done.
Let's go back and enjoy the party.

480
00:44:59,800 --> 00:45:01,160
He's heading to Hathaya's room.

481
00:45:30,160 --> 00:45:31,720
- Raiwin.
- Yes?

482
00:45:31,800 --> 00:45:33,480
Have you seen Hathaya?

483
00:45:34,080 --> 00:45:36,040
- No.
- Is something wrong?

484
00:45:37,360 --> 00:45:41,000
I was bringing her another drink,
but I don't know where she went.

485
00:45:42,520 --> 00:45:44,120
Father.

486
00:45:46,600 --> 00:45:48,040
Something disgraceful has happened.

487
00:45:48,120 --> 00:45:49,720
What happened?

488
00:45:50,320 --> 00:45:54,160
Ms. Liu, if there's anything

489
00:45:54,240 --> 00:45:55,520
we can do to help, just tell us.

490
00:45:56,680 --> 00:46:00,760
I saw Hathaya very drunk
and staggering back toward her room.

491
00:46:00,840 --> 00:46:03,280
I was going to check on her, but...

492
00:46:04,080 --> 00:46:07,080
I saw her lying there with a man.

493
00:46:09,120 --> 00:46:10,640
Who was the man?

494
00:46:11,800 --> 00:46:13,640
Father, you should see for yourself.

495
00:46:42,080 --> 00:46:43,400
No! Let go!

496
00:46:43,960 --> 00:46:46,320
Help!

497
00:46:48,400 --> 00:46:50,800
Go away. Don't do this to me!

498
00:46:50,880 --> 00:46:52,480
Go away!

499
00:46:52,560 --> 00:46:56,240
Get out! Who are you?

500
00:47:09,120 --> 00:47:12,360
Help! Help!

501
00:47:12,440 --> 00:47:14,800
Shut up!

502
00:47:16,680 --> 00:47:17,960
- Help!
- The hell are you doing?!

503
00:47:31,920 --> 00:47:33,640
Father, be careful.

504
00:47:50,000 --> 00:47:51,000
Hathaya.

505
00:47:52,800 --> 00:47:54,600
- Don't!
- It's me, Hathaya!

506
00:47:54,680 --> 00:47:56,840
- No! Get out!
- It's me. Calm down.

507
00:47:56,920 --> 00:47:59,840
- Get out! Out!
- Hathaya!

508
00:48:02,200 --> 00:48:04,120
Hathaya. Hathaya.

509
00:48:05,800 --> 00:48:07,640
Good grief!

510
00:48:07,720 --> 00:48:10,240
- Ramil!
- How disgraceful!

511
00:48:12,480 --> 00:48:14,440
What the hell is going on?

512
00:48:17,960 --> 00:48:20,640
This isn't what everyone thinks.

513
00:48:20,720 --> 00:48:21,800
I can explain.

514
00:48:25,320 --> 00:48:26,720
Everyone,

515
00:48:26,800 --> 00:48:28,640
I'll take care of Hathaya.

516
00:48:29,400 --> 00:48:31,920
Once she wakes up, she should
be able to explain everything.

517
00:48:34,400 --> 00:48:37,240
Hathaya, are you okay?

518
00:48:48,080 --> 00:48:49,880
So, Mr. Saksit,

519
00:48:49,960 --> 00:48:51,640
how are you going to take
responsibility for this?

520
00:48:51,720 --> 00:48:52,840
Well, I...

521
00:48:52,920 --> 00:48:54,080
I'll take responsibility.

522
00:48:54,160 --> 00:48:55,560
NEXT EPISODE

523
00:48:55,640 --> 00:48:56,920
<i>If you love Hathaya,</i>

524
00:48:57,840 --> 00:48:58,680
<i>then go tell Mr. Pichai.</i>

525
00:48:58,760 --> 00:49:00,440
<i>Don't lecture me.</i>

526
00:49:00,520 --> 00:49:03,000
I don't take another man's leftovers.

527
00:49:03,920 --> 00:49:05,360
<i>Stop causing trouble for once!</i>

528
00:49:09,200 --> 00:49:10,600
<i>You're promiscuous.</i>

529
00:49:11,760 --> 00:49:13,320
<i>You brought this filthy mess
into my house.</i>

530
00:49:13,920 --> 00:49:15,680
<i>You're no different from your mother.</i>

531
00:49:16,360 --> 00:49:18,640
Then why didn't you tell Grandpa?

532
00:49:20,280 --> 00:49:22,240
Because I hate you.

533
